00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.160
Computer: Emergency, 10 seconds-

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:53.920
Ah crap.

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:54.880
Computer: -of oxygen remaining.

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:58.040
I know, god it's so far away! I'm not gonna make it!

00:11:58.180 --> 00:11:59.660
