00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:00.760
Goddammit.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:03.580
Uh oh.

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:06.120
This is gonna be close.. aaahhhh!

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:11.280
So, this is the first one. And I don't see the PDA anywhere here.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:13.280
But that doesn't mean that it doesn't exist,

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:17.520
but it just means that I can't find it in this particular one. Maybe it's in there- nah.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:21.880
And maybe it's, uh, maybe I can find it if I dig around the sand but I-
*Growling*

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.700
whoa hey whoa whoa whoa whoa whoa.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:24.580
Where'd my knife go?

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:25.540
I had a knife!

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:27.100
Whooaaaa heeeey!

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:27.920
Whoa hey.

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:28.960
Ah! Screw you!

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:31.160
Alright, so now we're gonna go to the next one...

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:32.300
"Warp 150-"

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:37.760
So now, we're going to the second pod, which is in the safe shallows right here.

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:43.020
So as you can see, like there- there are a total of seven separate pods.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:51.520
I only have the coordinates for six of them, but they're all here, and they all tell their own story about... these...

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.800
poor people that just... did not make it.

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:56.920
It really sucks. Like it really sucks.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:00.080
Lemme try, uh, lemme get the scanner. Maybe that'll do it.

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:02.800
But anyway, I dug through the sand as best I could.

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:08.960
I could not find a PDA, which it said that there was, but apparently that is not the case.

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:13.320
I really hope this doesn't warp me very close to the Aurora because it- it's about to blaugh.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:14.160
Okay.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:15.560
Need some air first.

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:17.080
Hello everybody!

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:23.380
Most of these are actually in the safe shallows, so they're in places where things are generally ok- wow.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:27.180
This one just obliterated, holy crap!

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:29.200
Was this actually one of them?

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:30.480
Oh my god!

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:33.860
It- they couldn't have- there's a vending machine?! Holy shit!

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:36.880
I don't have to eat dirty alien fish anymore!

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:38.320
Holy crap.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:40.400
Ah, that's so weird.

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:41.800
That is one of them, yeah.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:42.600
Wow.

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:45.820
That pod just got obliterated.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.400
How would anyone even know that it was a pod?

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:50.580
