00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:27.640
Maybe I'll do it.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:28.520
I dunno.

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:29.600
Could be.

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:30.920
Who knows?

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:33.380
*Glitched computer voice: T-t-t-threeeeee. Twoooooo...*

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:34.280
[Possibility of being flubbernucked: 99.9%]

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:36.960
*explosion sounds*

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:37.860
Well, shit!

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:44.140
*continuous explosion sounds*

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:45.560
Naaah I'm good.

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:47.320
Cool beans for me!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:49.840
Uh oh.

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:53.760
Well, that's not good. I forgot that radiation was kind of a problem.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.860
But I need to see if there's something in here.

