00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:14.880
seat like I did.

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:17.680
And they were caught unawares.

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:20.340
And the Reaper Leviathan is out there.

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:22.880
I don't know- I'm still in the radiation zone. Shit.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:25.880
Damn, this is another one that just obliterated.

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:27.740
I don't even know!

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:30.720
