00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.180
This is a robotics arm.

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:34.980
That's a- oh w-wait, that's a locker. That's a locker.

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:37.200
Let me, uh, let me see about that one.

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:38.220
Shit.

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:39.360
ShIT.

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:40.740
SHIT.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:41.540
Gonna die.

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:43.900
You're gonna die! Need to check the locker!

