00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:51.560
Please tell me? Hello. Who're you? I've seen this picture before.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:53.460
She's beautiful!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:55.240
Computer: Caution, 30 seconds of oxygen remaining.

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:59.940
Well I've got a different problem. I- I- I think I'm gonna die, which is greeeaaaaat.

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:02.720
